'''Kiss and Koi''' (キスヨリ・ス・ゴイ, ''Kisuyori. Su. Goi'') are a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appear in [[Koi Awakens!]]. They were added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kiss and Koi
|image = E 251.png
|appearance = [[Koi Awakens!]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
It has rather low HP compared to other awakened units, but it has fast movement speed, attack speed, and range.

==Strategy==
Unlike most [[:Category:Enemy Cats|Cat counterparts]], this is actually a Floating enemy, so Anti-Floating units, especially those with over 400 range, work well against it.

==Encounters==
{{Collapsible}}
This enemy has always appeared at 100% strength magnification.
